// scan-settings-editors.jsx — shared editor subpages for Scan Settings.
//
// Three generic editors, each opened from a row on the Scan Settings page,
// each editing exactly ONE value with explicit Save / discard semantics:
//   • SoundEditor   — single-select Sound / Vibration / Silent
//   • ValueEditor   — currency amount via the shared MoneyKeypad
//   • BoolEditor    — single switch
//
// All three share SettingsEditorShell, which owns the slide-in chrome and
// the "Unsaved Changes" back-protection dialog.  The Save button is
// enabled only when the working value differs from the saved value.
//
// Relies on: TOKENS, CardGroup (components.jsx); FloatingBackButton +
// FloatingNavTitle (scans-device-subpage.jsx); MoneyKeypad (price-entry.jsx).

